---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import MermaidDiagram from '../../components/astro/MermaidDiagram.astro';
import { diagrams } from '../../data/diagrams';
---

<ProjectLayout title="AKS Infrastructure with Terraform - Mark Lester Perez" projectTitle="AKS Infrastructure with Terraform">
  <h2>Project Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Enterprise-grade Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) deployment using Terraform, implementing
    security best practices, advanced networking, and comprehensive monitoring solutions.
  </p>

  <h2>Technologies Used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)</li>
    <li>Terraform</li>
    <li>Azure Virtual Network</li>
    <li>Azure Monitor</li>
    <li>Azure Key Vault</li>
    <li>Azure Container Registry</li>
    <li>Azure Application Gateway</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Implementation Details</h2>

  <h3>Core Infrastructure</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Virtual Network with subnet segregation</li>
    <li>AKS cluster with system and user node pools</li>
    <li>Private cluster configuration</li>
    <li>Integration with Azure AD</li>
    <li>Container Registry with geo-replication</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Security Measures</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Azure AD integration for RBAC</li>
    <li>Network policies implementation</li>
    <li>Pod identity configuration</li>
    <li>Secret management with Key Vault</li>
    <li>Container security with Azure Defender</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Monitoring Setup</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Azure Monitor for containers</li>
    <li>Log Analytics workspace</li>
    <li>Application Insights integration</li>
    <li>Custom dashboards and alerts</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Architecture Diagram</h2>
  <MermaidDiagram diagram={diagrams.aks} />

  <h2>Architecture Overview</h2>
  <p>
    The infrastructure implements a production-ready AKS environment with:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Multi-region deployment capability</li>
    <li>Dedicated node pools for different workloads</li>
    <li>Private networking with Azure Firewall</li>
    <li>Automated scaling configurations</li>
    <li>Disaster recovery procedures</li>
  </ul>
</ProjectLayout>
